  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitfaster/BitFaster.Caching/tarball/v2.6.1",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitfaster/BitFaster.Caching/zipball/v2.6.1",
  "body": "## What's changed\r\n\r\n- Fixed a `ConcurrentLfu.Trim` thread safety bug that could corrupt internal data structures when called concurrently with write operations.\r\n- Fixed LFU striped-buffer concurrency level defaulting to 1 when the default concurrency level is used on .NET10, improving throughput on high-core machines.\r\n- Optimized internal bit operations to use intrinsics and eliminated loops.\r\n- Fixed a typo in IExpiryCalculator method docs.\r\n\r\nFull changelog: https://github.com/bitfaster/BitFaster.Caching/compare/v2.6.0...v2.6.1",
